==Serbian==

===Etymology===
From Turkish [[bre#Turkish|bre]].

===Cyrillic spelling===
*[[бре#Serbian|бре]]

===Interjection===
'''bre'''

# {{context|intensifier}} used to express passion about the point of a sentence, at any part of a sentence
# {{context|intensifier}} similar to English [[fuck]] or [[hell]], but not vulgar, e.g.:
#:''Šta si '''bre''' to uradio!?'' (What the '''[[fuck#Intensifier|fuck]]''' did you do!?)
# [[hey]]
# [[yo]] (''slang'')

